## Input

```css
.numeric {
  five: #12345;
  after-five: #ABC;
  seven: #1234567;
  after-seven: #ABCD;
  unit: #12px;
  after-unit: red;
  bare: #;
  after-bare: #ABCDEF;
  spaced: # app;
  after-spaced: #ABCDEF12;
  escaped-color: #\61 bc;
  after-escaped-color: #ABCG;
  escaped-color-middle: #a\62 c;
  after-escaped-color-middle: #Brand;
}

@container card if(style(--enabled: true): #app; else: #ABC) {
  .css-only { color: red; }
}
@container card if(style(--enabled: true): #ABCG; else: #ABC) {
  .css-only-prefix { color: red; }
}
.after { display: block; color: #ABC; }

```


